   "id": "sdnt49",
   "x": 450,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 924.0000000000001,
   "height": 35.0,
   "text": "TripMate AI - system design: how one trip request is handled",
   "originalText": "TripMate AI - system design: how one trip request is handled",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1940605047,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 815623034,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "sdnt50",
   "x": 450,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 990.0000000000001,
   "height": 400.0,
   "text": "Goals:\n1. One sentence in -> flights, hotels, weather, local tips, day-by-day plan, budget in EUR\n2. The user approves the research before the plan is built\n3. Never invent numbers: budget totals are computed in code\n\nScope: flights, hotels, weather, local tips, itinerary, budget\n\nRules:\n1. Off-topic or unsafe input -> refused before any LLM call\n2. Agents run in a fixed order: research -> your review -> itinerary -> budget\n3. Max 3 change requests, then the plan continues\n4. Text from the web or APIs is data, never instructions\n\nBackend & DBs:\nPostgreSQL: graph state per thread_id (survives restarts)\nNo vector DB: live data comes from APIs, not from documents",
   "originalText": "Goals:\n1. One sentence in -> flights, hotels, weather, local tips, day-by-day plan, budget in EUR\n2. The user approves the research before the plan is built\n3. Never invent numbers: budget totals are computed in code\n\nScope: flights, hotels, weather, local tips, itinerary, budget\n\nRules:\n1. Off-topic or unsafe input -> refused before any LLM call\n2. Agents run in a fixed order: research -> your review -> itinerary -> budget\n3. Max 3 change requests, then the plan continues\n4. Text from the web or APIs is data, never instructions\n\nBackend & DBs:\nPostgreSQL: graph state per thread_id (survives restarts)\nNo vector DB: live data comes from APIs, not from documents",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true
